'''Snowglobe''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2023 Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2023]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade has an aurora sky, along with additional Christmas trees, and a bricky house at the bottom. The guard is white resembling snow, while the handle is orange with a blob of snow.
